{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a VR shooting game with a warm camp atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, many wild animals come to the mine in search of food and will actively attack you. Therefore, you can only sleep and replenish ammunition during the day. Experience survival in the mine from a first-person perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, you must conserve bullets\u2014once you run out, you\u2019ll become easy prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you survive, the more animals will attack you, challenging your survival time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a development system: each day you survive, you accumulate gold coins that can be used to upgrade weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons and activate infrared auto-aim.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Device Requirements:</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> A device that supports OpenXR is required.</span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564880?t=1742368741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564880?t=1742368741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564880/beab8be082e49457d52a90b6e023b03ca4eebfae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742368741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564880/beab8be082e49457d52a90b6e023b03ca4eebfae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742368741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a VR shooting game with a warm camp atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, many wild animals come to the mine in search of food and will actively attack you. Therefore, you can only sleep and replenish ammunition during the day. Experience survival in the mine from a first-person perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, you must conserve bullets\u2014once you run out, you\u2019ll become easy prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you survive, the more animals will attack you, challenging your survival time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a development system: each day you survive, you accumulate gold coins that can be used to upgrade weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons and activate infrared auto-aim.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Device Requirements:</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> A device that supports OpenXR is required.</span></p>","developers":["\u591c\u884c\u8005","night walker"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564880/19f79c6d3b8bfe781648f98d5c44f809e99814ad/header.jpg?t=1742368741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108703,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108703/movie480.mp4?t=1741240605","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108703/movie_max.mp4?t=1741240605"},"name":"555","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108703/2207764df0c5515a5136d513d5cb715023839afe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741240605","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108703/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741240605","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108703/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741240605"}}],"name":